#. module: event_management
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:event_management.homepage
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\" Launching our new skincare line had to feel high-"
"end and intimate. The team transformed a rooftop into a luxe garden lounge "
"with live music, media coverage, and personalized gifting. It was a night to "
"remember and the press loved it.&amp;nbsp;\"</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\" Predstavitev naše nove linije izdelkov za nego kože "
"je morala delovati prestižno in intimno. Ekipa je streho preoblikovala v "
"razkošen vrtni salon z živo glasbo, medijsko pokritostjo in "
"personaliziranimi darili. To je bil večer, ki si ga bomo zapomnili, in "
"novinarji so ga vzljubili.&amp;nbsp;\"</span>"

#. module: event_management
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:event_management.homepage
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\" Our annual fundraiser needed a refresh and what a "
"transformation! Elegant venue, seamless donor experience, entertainment, and "
"a record-breaking silent auction. We raised more than ever before.\"​</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\" Naša letna dobrodelna prireditev je potrebovala "
"prenovo in kakšna preobrazba! Elegantno prizorišče, brezhibna izkušnja za "
"donatorje, zabavni program in rekordna tiha dražba. Zbrali smo več kot kdaj "
"koli prej.\"​</span>"

#. module: event_management
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:event_management.homepage
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\" We needed a retreat to align our growing team. They "
"delivered an unforgettable three-day mountain getaway; complete with "
"workshops, activities, and even a surprise bonfire night. Everything ran "
"like clockwork. Our team came back energized and closer than ever.&amp;nbsp;"
"\"</span>"
msgstr ""
"<span class=\"h4-fs\">\" Potrebovali smo oddih, da bi povezali našo rastočo "
"ekipo. Pripravili so nam nepozaben tridnevni oddih v gorah, skupaj z "
"delavnicami, dejavnostmi in celo presenetljivim večerom ob tabornem ognju. "
"Vse je potekalo kot po maslu. Naša ekipa se je vrnila polna energije in bolj "
"povezana kot kdaj koli prej.&amp;nbsp;\"</span>"

